<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CodeAlpha - Task 1 Image Gallery</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial;background:#f5f5f5;margin:0;padding:20px}
h1{text-align:center;color:#333}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:15px;padding:20px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
.gallery img{width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);transition:0.3s;cursor:pointer}
.gallery img:hover{transform:scale(1.05)}
.footer{text-align:center;margin-top:30px;color:#666}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>My Image Gallery - CodeAlpha Task 1</h1>
<div class="gallery">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=1">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=2">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=3">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=4">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=5">
<img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=6">
</div>
<div class="footer">
<p>Created by Poonam Bora | CodeAlpha Internship Task 1</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
